    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in Uva and Eastern provinces after 2.00 p.m. Fairly strong winds about (30-40) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the central hills, Northern, North-central, North-western and Southern provinces and in Trincomalee district.",
